                <pb facs="0724" n="674" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv12/pg674"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 181.9202/91: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate Peace to Officer in Charge
                        in General Bandholtz’ Absence</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-09-08">September 8, 1919</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>27. [From Polk.] Please rush following message to General Bandholtz: “Do not be
                    drawn into discussion of diplomatic questions with Roumanian officials. Please
                    telegraph immediately object of your trip.” Polk.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">Am</hi>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">erican</hi>]
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mission</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
